            </p>

            <h2>9. Governing Law</h2>
            <p>
                These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa. Any disputes shall be resolved in the courts of Gqeberha.
            </p>

            <h2>10. Contact</h2>
            <p>
                For questions about these Terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:legal@nmblab.co.za">legal@nmblab.co.za</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>